# usually return early.  The second line is the first repair phase;
# it calls resource rematching, then ejection chains, then VLSN
# search using optimal reassignment by dynamic programming.  The
# third line is the second repair phase.  It runs for half as long
# as the first and omits the resource assignment invariant and
